      "cooked": "<p>COLLECTING DONATIONS through January 1st ONLY. This is a short period of time. Please do not delay.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I was inspired this morning by a post I saw on Twitter. Paraphrased from someone tweeting about the current sale: \"I love this game, but I can't afford the expansions\".</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>I'd like &nbsp;help big fans of the game get more of the digital content, so here's what I propose:</span></p><ul>\n<li>People who want to give will pool our money</li>\n<li>People who are big fans and can afford the base game but not the expansions will get help getting the expansions.</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you'd like to give, use Paypal to SEND A GIFT (to avoid fees) to arenson@spatzel.net. Please also send me an email or a PM letting me know what you are giving.</p><p>If you'd like to receive, first buy the base game and then send me a PM. PM's only for receiver's please. I am targetting these donations to forum members. Let me know which expansions you need.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Handelabra's winter sale goes through January 2nd. The base game is on sale for only $2.99. I am assuming everyone can afford that, so if you're really a big fan, you have or can buy that for yourself.&nbsp;<a href=\"http://handelabra.com/blog/2016/12/20/our-winter-sale-begins\">http://handelabra.com/blog/2016/12/20/our-winter-sale-begins</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wondering how much to give?</p><ul>\n<li>Season Pass 1 is currently 20% off for $19.99</li>\n<li>Season Pass 2 is $24.99</li>\n</ul>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
